        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_1"] = "Michael's last credstick\\ntransaction:\\n\\nStokers Coffin Motel,\\nRedmond Barrens.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_2"] = "Must pay Stoker 250$ to\\nget Michael's stuff.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_3"] = "<The letter addressed to\\nMichael reads as follows:\\n\\n  M--I don't trust our\\nJohnson, and neither\\nshould you!  His story\\njust doesn't wash and you\\nknow it.  I'm out on this\\none and I hope you are\\ntoo.  I'll wait for you\\nat the Tarislar City Inn\\nin Puyallup Barrens.\\n\\n      Tabatha Shale >",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_4"] = "\\n<Holopix>\\n\\n\\n        Dr. Ivanna\\n     Haversheen, M.D.\\n\\n         Seattle\\n     General Hospital\\n\\n    Haversheen Clinic",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_5"] = "\\n<Holopix>\\n\\n\\n        Mr. Caleb\\n     Brightmore, Esq.\\n\\n     Problems solved.\\n\\n   Worries eliminated.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_6"] = "Caleb Brightmore, a Mr.\\nJohnson taking orders\\nfrom another unknown\\nMr. Johnson, assembled\\nMichael's team to go\\ninto the Salish-Shidhe.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_7"] = "Tabatha speculates that\\nBoris Errascoe was the\\nlast person to see\\nMichael alive.\\n\\nBoris Errascoe is a\\nsmall-time fixer working\\nout of an abandoned\\ngreenhouse in the\\nRedmond Barrens.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_8"] = "Boris Errascoe is a\\nsmall-time fixer working\\nout of an abandoned\\ngreenhouse in the\\nRedmond Barrens.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_9"] = "<Holopix>\\n\\n David William Owlfeather\\n\\n  Salish-Shidhe Rangers\\n    Wilderness Patrol",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_10"] = "Owlfeather is stationed\\nat the Ranger Outpost in\\nthe AmerIndian Village.\\n\\nA Visa is required for\\nentrance to the\\nSalish-Shidhe.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_11"] = "Owlfeather will name\\nsomeone who can help,\\nbut only if his brother\\nis returned.\\n\\nHis brother's name is\\nAragorn and he was last\\nreported in Seattle.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_12"] = "Aragorn, Owlfeather's\\nbrother, was quite vocal\\naround town about taking\\non a corporation for a\\nlocal \"Johnson\".\\n\\nHe has not been seen\\nsince.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_13"] = "Aragon was caught by\\nMitsuhama in a failed\\nShadowrun.\\n\\nHe is being detained\\ninside the corporation.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_14"] = "You freed Aragorn from\\nMitsuhama who then ran\\noff without any \"thanks\".\\n\\nUngrateful wretch!\\n\\nMaybe Owlfeather will\\ngive you the name of\\nhis friend anyway.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_15"] = "Owlfeather tells you to\\nseek out Spirit Eyes.\\n\\nHe is a powerful shaman\\nat the Medicine Lodge on\\nCouncil Island.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_16"] = "Spirit Eyes needs three\\nspell components so he\\ncan discern the true\\nidentity of your enemy.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_17"] = "The first item is the\\nhorn of a Gargoyle.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_18"] = "The second item is the\\npelt of a Hellhound.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_19"] = "The third item is the\\nliving scale of a\\nFeathered Serpent.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_20"] = "Your enemy is an evil\\nbeing with the face of\\na jackal.\\n\\nHis name is Thon.\\n\\nHe is the one who had\\nMichael killed.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_21"] = "Renraku began harassing\\nBoris after Michael had\\nvisited him to purchase\\nequipment for his run.\\n\\nMako Sochou is heading\\nthe Renraku inquiry.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_22"] = "Mako has been spending\\na lot of his time at\\nClub Penumbra lately.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_23"] = "Michael's run was a\\nreconnaissance mission\\nto seek out a cave deep\\nin the wilderness.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_24"] = "The run contract was\\ngiven to Caleb by an elf\\nnamed Frosty.\\n\\nHe says that she hangs\\nout in the Puyallup\\nBarrens.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_25"] = "Mako's orders were to\\nkeep track of Michael's\\nprogress.\\n\\nAfter the team's demise,\\na new project director\\nreplaced Mako.\\n\\nHis name is Ito Ogami.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_26"] = "Ito Ogami is part of a\\nspecial projects team\\nthat gets sent in to\\nclean up botched\\nmissions.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_27"] = "Ito Ogami is staying at\\nthe Gates Undersound\\nHotel in Downtown\\nSeattle.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_28"] = "Ito Ogami is holding a\\nmeeting at Matchstick\\nin Downtown Seattle.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_29"] = "The Sinsearach Tribal\\nElders will not answer\\nyour questions until\\nyou've proven your\\ntrustworthiness.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_30"] = "Your current task is to\\ndeliver a gift from\\nLady Gillian to Red\\nBuffalo Woman in the\\nAmerIndian Village.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_31"] = "You have a return gift\\nfrom Red Buffalo Woman\\nfor Lady Gillian.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_32"] = "Your current task is to\\nfind Ilene Two Fists\\nand see her safely\\nreturned to the\\nSinsearach.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_33"] = "Ilene is doing time in\\nHollywood Correctional\\nfor a botched run on\\nAres.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_34"] = "You have completed your\\nsecond task by freeing\\nIlene from Hollywood.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_35"] = "You have vowed to aid,\\ndefend, and respect the\\nSinsearach for the rest\\nof your life.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_36"] = "You have refused to\\naid, defend, and respect\\nthe Sinsearach for the\\nrest of your life and are\\nnow at an impasse with\\nthe tribal elders.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_37"] = "Frosty is a member of\\nthe Sinsearach elves.\\n\\nThe tribal lands of the\\nSinsearach are south of\\nthe AmerIndian Village.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_38"] = "Harlequin is Frosty's\\nemployer.\\n\\nHe can be found in the\\nPuyallup Barrens at the\\nTalisar Garden Apts.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_39"] = "Thon is a powerful free-\\nspirit who must destroy\\nmagical artifacts to\\nreplenish his energies.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_40"] = "Harlequin thinks that\\nOgami and Renraku may\\nhave some information\\nyou are lacking.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_41"] = "Harlequin suggests a run\\nagainst Renraku to \\nsearch for information\\nthey may have on your\\nbrother or Thon.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_42"] = "You possess a map which\\nis meant to overlay a\\nsecond map.\\n\\nWithout the second map,\\nit doesn't do you much\\ngood...yet!",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_43"] = "You now possess both the\\nlandmark map and its\\noverlay.\\n\\nThe completed map now\\nshows you what you're\\nlooking for.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_44"] = "Thon is looking for\\nEllisia's tomb.\\n\\nHe hopes to find many\\npotent magical items\\nto absorb energy from.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_45"] = "Seek out Vigore and Jarl\\nfor answers concerning\\nThon and your brother's\\ndeath.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_46"] = "Vigore and Jarl have a\\nsecret base somewhere\\nin the Rat's Nest.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_47"] = "Now that you know the\\nexact location of the\\ntomb, Harlequin has\\narranged transportation\\nfor you to get there.\\n\\nHe is waiting for you to\\nassemble and equip your\\nteam of shadowrunners\\nto go and confront Thon.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_48"] = "Renraku suspects that\\nVigore and Jarl are\\nworking for Thon.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_49"] = "You have Ito's personal\\npasscode.\\n\\nIt is quite possible\\nthat all his information\\nis still in those\\ndatastores.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_50"] = "With Ito dead, maybe\\na run against Renraku\\nwill garner something.\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_51"] = "Stark is dying in the\\nwilderness.\\n\\nHe needs medical help\\nin order to move him.\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_52"] = "Stark's heart is\\nfailing and a normal\\ntransplant won't be\\nstrong enough to power\\nhis cybernetic body.\\n\\nFuchi has a prototype\\ncyber-heart that is\\nbeing kept in their\\nbuilding awaiting\\nshipping orders.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_53"] = "You have the prototype\\ncyber-heart!\\n\\nNow back to Seattle\\nGeneral to see if it'll\\nhelp Stark.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_54"] = "Gunderson seemed curious\\nabout Vigore's doings\\nin the Rat's Nest in\\nRedmond Barrens.\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_55"] = "H\\n\\n\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_56"] = "H\\n\\n\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_57"] = "H\\n\\n\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_58"] = "H\\n\\n\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_59"] = "H\\n\\n\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_60"] = "H\\n\\n\\n",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_61"] = "To: VP of R&D\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nThe Tomb of Ellisia is\\nconfirmed to be somewhere\\nin the Salish-Shidhe.\\n\\nThon is certain the tomb\\ncontains powerful magical\\nartifacts we can profit\\nfrom.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_62"] = "To: Renraku Accounting\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nPlease deduct further\\nVigore payments from\\nthe Thon account. Vigore\\nis under his employ.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_63"] = "To: Strike Team Captain\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nDo not follow Thon or\\nhis men any longer.\\n\\nWe cannot risk alerting\\nhim until we have both\\npieces of the map.\\n\\nThe piece we have will\\nbe secured in the upper\\nlevels of the Arcology.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_64"] = "To: Mako Sachou\\n\\nFr: Strike Team Captain\\n\\nThe men are becoming\\nrestless. I request a\\nRecon unit be assigned\\nto watch over these\\nShadowrunners, unless\\nyou want them dead soon.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_65"] = "Fr: Hotel Reception\\n\\nTo: Hotel Reservations\\n\\nMr. Ito Orgami has\\nrequested the penthouse\\nsuite.\\n\\nMr. Ito will be staying\\nindefinitely.\\n\\nForward bill to Renraku\\nAccounting.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_66"] = "Fr: Hotel Reception\\n\\nTo: Hotel Reservations\\n\\nSuite 1345 is available\\nfor immediate vacancy\\nof any visiting VIP.\\n\\nUnless changed, the term\\nof stay is indefinite,\\nbilled to the hotel.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_67"] = "To: VP of R&D\\n\\nFr: Lone Star Security\\n\\nPrototype cybernetic\\nheart set for transport.\\n\\nFull security procedures\\nwill be followed.\\n\\nWe are awaiting the\\nfinal paperwork.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_68"] = "To: Fuchi Security\\n\\nFr: VP of R&D\\n\\nWe will be receiving the\\nprototype cybernetic\\nsoon. Be sure to place\\nit in a secure area.\\n\\nI suggest you use the\\nthird floor, as it is\\nthe most secure.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_69"] = "To: All Concerned\\n\\nFr: Head of Security\\n       Mitsuhama\\n\\nWe had a break-in!!\\nPerp was a lone male\\nAmerIndian.\\n\\nWe have neutralized him\\nand are holding him for\\nquestioning.\\n\\nWe will detain him until\\nhe tells us what we want\\nto know.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_70"] = "To: Head of Security\\n\\nFr: Mitsuhama\\n      Interrogations\\n\\nThe prisoner has cracked\\nsomewhat.  The arrogant\\ndrek let his name slip.\\nHe's called Aragorn.\\n\\nI am transferring him to\\nthe fifth floor, to\\nincrease the pressure.\\n\\nI will inform you when I\\nbreak him further.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_71"] = "To: All Officers\\n\\nFr: Lone Star Dispatch\\n\\nWanted: Caucasian male,\\nage 18-24, 6 ft 1.\\n\\nPreliminary reports \\nsuggest the suspect goes\\nby the name of Joshua.\\n\\nWanted for questioning in\\nin relation to various\\ncrimes.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_72"] = "To: All Detectives\\n\\nFr: Lone Star Dispatch\\n\\nWanted: Caucasian male,\\nage 18-24, 6 ft 1.\\n\\nGoes by the street name\\nJoshua.\\n\\nSuspected of breaking\\nvarious laws. May be\\narmed and dangerous.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_73"] = "To: All Hunting Parties\\n\\nFr: Lone Star Dispatch\\n\\nWanted: Caucasian male,\\nage 18-24, 6 ft 1.\\n\\nGoes by the street name\\nJoshua.\\n\\nCurrently a fugitive of\\njustice.\\n\\nTerminate with extreme\\npredjudice.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_74"] = "To: Lone Star Records\\n\\nFr: L.S. Detention\\n\\nThe prisoner Vigore has\\nbeen transferred from our\\ndetention facilities to\\nHollywood Correctional.\\n\\nVigore's files have\\nbeen transferred also.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_75"] = "To: Lone Star Records\\n\\nFr: L.S. Detention\\n\\nThe prisoner Boris\\nErrascoe has been\\ntransferred from our\\ndetention facilities to\\nHollywood Correctional.\\n\\nErrascoe's files have\\nbeen transferred also.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_76"] = "To: P&L Accounts\\n\\nFr: Fuchi Finance\\n\\nThe payment has been\\ntransferred to your\\naccount for the armed\\nescort.\\n\\nThe cybernetic heart is\\nsafely in our Corporate\\nOffice.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_77"] = "To: Head of Security\\n\\nFr: VP of Publicity\\n\\nDue to the unfortunate\\nnature of the recent\\nsecurity breach, we must\\ngive up this Ilene Two\\nFists to Hollywood Corr.\\n\\nIn the future, I suggest\\nwe cancel our contract\\nwith Lone Star Security,\\nand deal with problems\\nlike this ourselves.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_78"] = "To: Cell Records\\n\\nFr: Guardpost #12\\n\\nI have received prisoner\\n#639946, AKA Ilene Two\\nFists.\\n\\nShe is located with the\\nother women prisoners on\\nnorth block.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_79"] = "To: Cell Records\\n\\nFr: Hllywd. Parole Board\\n\\nPrisoner #597030, AKA\\nVigore, must be released\\nfrom incarceration.\\n\\nVigore has been a model\\nprisoner and it is the\\nqualified opinion of this\\nboard he has reformed.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_80"] = "To: Cell Records\\n\\nFr: Hllywd Parole Board\\n\\nPrisoner #575832, AKA\\nBoris Errascoe, should\\nbe be released from\\nincarceration.\\n\\nErrascoe has not been the\\nideal prisoner, but has\\nserved his sentence to\\ncompletion.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_81"] = "To: Mako Sochou\\n\\nFr: Renraku Surveillance\\n\\nSir,\\nWe have tracked down a\\nFeathered Serpent in\\nthe Sinsearach Caves.\\n\\nIt is located in the far\\neast cave below the \\nSinsearach compound.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_82"] = "To: VP of R&D\\n\\nFr: Renraku Personnel\\n\\nWe have removed Mako \\nSachou as Project Leader\\nof \"Operation THON\".\\n\\nHis failure in tracking\\nthe subjects has been\\nnoted.\\n\\nHis replacement is on his\\nway and will resume the\\nsearch ASAP.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_83"] = "To: VP of R&D\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nConfirmed - Frosty after\\nEllisia.\\n\\nHave recovered the map,\\nand it's locked in my\\nsafe in the Arcology.\\n\\nAll Project files have\\nbeen transferred to my \\npersonal system.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_84"] = "To: VP of R&D\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nI have resumed a dialog\\nwith Vigore.  Thon is \\nanxious for the Project\\nto proceed.\\n\\nI will stop at nothing\\nto complete this Project.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_85"] = "To: Mako Sochou\\n\\nFr: Renraku Surveilence\\n\\nWe have located Frosty.\\n\\nLast seen leaving the \\nTarislar City Inn.\\n\\nShe then headed for the\\nSinsearach.  We lost\\ntrack of her soon after.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_86"] = "To: Strike Team Captains\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nA meddler named Joshua\\nhas become too involved\\nin our affairs lately.\\n\\nHunt him down and make\\nhim understand we are\\nnone of his concern.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_87"] = "To: Strike Team Captains\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nAn unknown force has\\ncompromised the Project\\n\\nThis force is led by a\\nman with the street name\\nJoshua.\\n\\nFind him and remove him\\nfrom our equation.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_88"] = "To: Strike Team Captains\\n\\nFr: Ito Ogami\\n\\nJoshua has become too\\ninvolved in the Project.\\nThe first Team to bring\\nme his head will receive\\na 50,000$ bonus.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_89"] = "To: Mako Sachou\\n\\nFr: Renraku Surveillance\\n\\nFrosty has unwittingly\\ngiven us assistance on\\nthe Ellisia Project.\\n\\nWe have retrieved an\\nancient parchement\\nwhich appears to be\\na map of some kind.\\n\\nThe map has been moved\\nto the Renraku Arcology.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_90"] = "To: VP of R&D\\n\\nFr: Head of Security\\n\\nSir,\\nI regret to inform you\\nour copy of the map to \\nEllisia's tomb has been\\nstolen, perhaps by Thon's\\nmen.\\n\\nWith the map gone, and\\nboth Sachou and Ogami\\ndead, we cannot hope to\\nfind the Tomb.",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_91"] = "Fr: Ares\\n\\nTo: Aztechnology\\n\\nNewsNet Data:\\n\\n Seattle Corps band\\n together to form power\\n cartel... Prices rise.\\n\\n\\nPasscode: ------B--",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_92"] = "Fr: Renraku\\n\\nTo: Fuchi\\n\\nNewsNet Data:\\n\\n Virus brings down new\\n computer system in\\n South America.\\n\\n Origin traced to\\n system files.\\n\\n\\nPasscode: ----N---L",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_93"] = "Fr: Aztechnology\\n\\nTo: Mitsuhama\\n\\nNewsNet Data:\\n\\n Nuclear winter for \\n Bismark, North Dakota,\\n after reactor mishap.\\n\\n\\nPasscode: C----O---",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_94"] = "Fr: Fuchi\\n\\nTo: Ares\\n\\nNewsNet Data:\\n\\n State-of-the-art\\n computer installed in\\n Shiawase Atomic Nuclear\\n Plant, Redmond Barrens.\\n\\n\\nPasscode: -H-R-----",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_95"] = "Fr: Mitsuhama\\n\\nTo: Renraku\\n\\nNewsNet Data:\\n\\n Corps indicted in\\n matrix sabotage.\\n\\n Renraku, Fuchi, Ares,\\n Mitsuhama, and Lone\\n Star all suspected.\\n\\n\\nPasscode: --E----Y-",
        ["pocket_secretary.notebook.tips.option.tip_96"] = "You have deleted the\\nvirus and saved the\\ncitizens of Redmond\\nBarrens.\\n\\nYou also manage to\\ndivert a large sum of\\ncreds to your account.\\n\\nSEGA of America thanks\\nyou for your efforts!",
        ["field.main_menu.passcodes.title"] = "Passcodes",
